<title>USA: TABLE-Denbury Resources Q2 net income rises.</title>
<headline>TABLE-Denbury Resources Q2 net income rises.</headline>
<dateline>DALLAS 1997-08-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Denbury Resources Inc</p>
<p>					   Three months ended</p>
<p>						     June 30,  Percentage</p>
<p>					1997	   1996	  Change</p>
<p>Total revenues		   19,015	 11,682	 63%</p>
<p>NET INCOME			  2,207	  1,215	 82%</p>
<p>Earnings per common share:</p>
<p>   Primary			   0.11	   0.11	  0%</p>
<p>   Fully diluted		   0.11	   0.11	  0%</p>
<p>Average common shares outstanding</p>
<p>					20,156	 11,555	74%</p>
<p>					   Six months ended</p>
<p>						     June 30,  Percentage</p>
<p>					1997	   1996	  Change</p>
<p> Total revenues			   40,668   20,774	 96%</p>
<p> NET INCOME				  7,422    2,595	186%</p>
<p>Earnings per common share:</p>
<p>   Primary				    0.37     0.23	 60%</p>
<p>   Fully diluted			    0.35     0.23	 52%</p>
<p> Average common shares outstanding  20,125   11,512	 75%</p>
<p>(amounts in thousands, except per share data)</p>
<p>NOTE: -- Company says it's continuing its active development program projected to be between $60 and $70 million for 1997, of which approximately $32.6 million had been incurred as of June 30.  In addition, the company says has committed to approximately $12 million of additional acquisitions which are expected to close during the third quarter.</p>
</text>
